  "components.food.pickupHint": ["Damit andere wissen, was noch da ist.","So others know what is left.","Başkaları ne kaldığını bilsin.","ليعرف الآخرون ما تبقّى.","Da drugi znaju što je ostalo.","Così gli altri sanno cosa rimane.","Dann wissen andere, was noch da ist."],
